#7651
Silver Musician Energy~
A Silver Musician~
This beautiful silver creature is playing her own arm as a violin.
~
This creature is made of some sort of silver energy.   It is both solid yet
she seems as light as the air itself.  Her arm twists and reforms into the
shape of a  violin and she strums the instrument with her other human arm.
She ignores you and continues to play.
~
