#7656
Delight Young Girl twirling~
Delight~
This young girl is twirling and laughing with delight.
~
This young girl is oblivious to you.  She spins and dances in joy.  Her
movements are almost a blur.  She darts from one place to another,
summersaulting and doing hand stands.  She is as innocent as a child can be,
yet the way the air shimmers around her distrubs you.  This entire place seems
to shudder and shake in her prescensce.
~
