#7657
Chocolate Leopard cat monster~
A Chocolate Leopard~
This odd cat is made entirely of chocolate, yet it breathes fire!
~
This jungle cat is made entirely of chocolate.  It's claws are chocolate, it's
eyes are chocolate. Yet, the power of its strikes rips your armor and fire
spews from its mouth.   It is a creature that has no logical connection to the
world.  It is madness and imagination given life.  It sees you and knows
that you are food.
~
