#7661
Yellow force elemental~
Yellow~
The colors! They are at war! It's coming right at you!
~
Yellow.  How do you see only yellow? The colors are at war.  Green is already
dead.  Blue is somewhere.  But here is Yellow.  How do you fight a color? How
does a color hurt you? What is going on?  What monster resides in this place?
Are you losing your mind. No you feel fine.  But here is Yellow.
~
