Red force elemental~
Red~
The colors! They are at war! It's coming right at you!
~
Red. It is love.  It is passion.  Red is the natural progression of emotion.
Wait,  what is it? The walls are bleeding.  The world is bleeding.  It is a
color. It is nothing, not even air.  A color is not real.  Is a blind man
immune? Where is Green? Where is Blue?  Do not forget you are real.
~
