Blue force elemental~
Blue~
The colors! They are at war! It's coming right at you!
~
Blue.  You miss the sky.  The sky is above you but it feels like you are
walking on it.  It is the last of it's kind.  Blue is alone.  It is scared.
It does not know you, it cannot know you as you cannot claim to have had a
conversation with a color.  It rages and you feel hate.  Color can hate.  What
color is hate?
~
