Delirium~
Delirium~
This young girl twists reality as she twirls her fingers in her hair.
~
Delirium was once the beauty of Delight.  She is still beautiful but her eyes
are dazed and her movements are confused.  She moves as if she is unsure the
ground will be there with each step.  Butterflies fly from her lips with each
breath and melt into daggers as they reach higher into the sky.  Delirium does
not know what she is, only that is.
~
