A Howling Wrath Of Madness~
This wraith pierces your soul with a shriek.
~
This wraith was once a proud and handsome warrior.  But now he has been
twisted and given torment in undeath.  His armor has been striped and his body
is ash and memory.  He shrieks with pain and the realization he will never
taste glory again.
~
