Fallen Angel~
A Fallen Angel~
This Angel has descended into despair and madness.
~
This angel was once a proud soldier of the light.  But even Angels can feel
despair.  Even gods can fall into the abyss.  This Angel still wears the
vestments of his position, but by the blood on his wings and the lunacy in his
eyes, he is no longer a servant of the righteous.
~
