A Patron Saint Of Seers~
This celestial woman is the guidance of those gifted with the second sight.
~
This woman is the patron saint of all seers.  She is responsible for blessing
those with the second sight and responsible for their continued success. All
those that scry, look into bowls, or rely on cards are silently praying to her
and her kinds.
~
