To those that enter this hallowed place, beware.

There is no forgiveness here, there is only glory.
There is no break, there is no respite.
The rewards are great, even greater with risk.



-Nameless



P.S.
This zone is inspired by Neil Gaiman's Sandman series of graphic novels.
All praise due to a magnificent writer.
