Delirium's Garden Party~
You are walking on the notes of music.  That is the only way to explain it.
You are nothing solid, there is no ground and there is no sky.  There is music
and somehow each note carries you foward just a bit more.  There are colors
that you cannot see but you know they are there because they told you so.
Delight is gone.  Who is the host of this party?
~
