#7747
Desire's Embrace~
You suddenly feel as if something is missing from your world.  You want.  You
need. You must have.  But you do not know what.  This is the heart of desire.
This is where it burns, where it builds, where it is born.  It is part of your
heart, your soul, and you know that somehow you are inside your body.  The god
before you smiles like a serpent.
~
