Dream's Castle~
You are in a library of some sort.  The book shelves reach into the sky, not
to the ceiling but rather out of it and into eternity.  The shelves are warped
and twisted and books seem to float back and forth into the different shelves.
You look at some of the titles and you hardly recognize any of them.
